# Build context hygiene for the admin-panel image (prod-01 task_02).
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` drags the host's node_modules AND .next (incl. the
# webpack PERSISTENT cache `.next/cache`) into the build. That cache leaks stale
# compiled modules — e.g. modules compiled on the host WITHOUT
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL — so `npm run build` reuses them and the baked
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* value comes out inconsistent (some chunks `/api`, others the
# `http://localhost:8001` fallback). Excluding them makes the image build
# deterministic (deps come from the `deps` stage `npm ci`; .next is built fresh)
# and much smaller/faster.

node_modules
.next
.turbo

# Local-only / non-source
.env
.env.*
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Test + e2e artifacts (never needed in the runtime image)
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
coverage
